diff --git a/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7993.bugfix b/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7993.bugfix
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..28fc229
--- /dev/null
+++ b/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7993.bugfix
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+Fix a crash when a message template contained custom (escaped) braces.
+The arguments of ``--msg-template`` are now parsed with ``string.Formatter``
+so that escaped braces (``{{`` and ``}}``) are no longer mistaken for message
+fields.
+
+Closes #7993
